r changes or and not anyways etc. See [LINK=CIVILIZATION_BARBARIAN]Barbarians (Civilization)[\LINK] for details ingame or/and the XML for example for the Steam version of the game (adjust to where your AdvCiv-SAS mod is if path is different or/and you don't use the Steam version of the game) C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Sid Meier's Civilization IV Beyond the Sword\Beyond the Sword\Mods\AdvCiv-SAS\Assets\XML\Civilizations\CIV4CivilizationInfos.xml and related files like CIV4BuildingInfos.xml and CIV4HandicapInfo.xml or/and such.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE][BOLD]Fixes[\BOLD][NEWLINE]- Fixed AdvCiv/Civ 4 bug where Gandhi's nowar attitude prob were pleased(110) / pleased(115) instead of (seemingly how should be if i am not mistaken anyways etc) pleased(110) / friendly(115)[NEWLINE]- Fixed a bug (seemingly) too anywyas etc in base AdvCiv/Civ4 where barbarians could build shwedagon paya as happened in auto play, hopefully fixed now, anyways etc</English>
